    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwa wu'swanano",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombaga na Mose, aho ndi' v'afwa av'o v'ana v'av'i'li' v'amwa Aloni, ha itungo i'lo ndi' v'egela ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamuwi'laga ati', “Muwi'le mudu'gu'yo Aloni, ku'du' ize av'e ali'wingi'la Hantu' Hasondo Muno ku' itungo i'lo li'kakoov'iwa, ha nnuma na muki'ngo ha mbele ya nfundi' ya wu'swanano, i'yo yi'li' ha igu'lya na isandi'ko lya ilagano, ki'gele ku'du' ize afwe, ku'nguno ene ndav'age nu'wigelisya mugati' na ilunde ha igu'lya na nfundi' yeni'yo ya wu'swanano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aloni aho alav'e ali'wingi'la ha Hantu' Hasondo Muno yi'lamudime ku'fumya vintu' i'vi mbela: ng'ombe nzagamba ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi na ng'ondi ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloge minzi' muv'i'li' gose, haho alavizwale i'vyo vizwalo visondo vya katani. Alazwale nhanzo nsondo, vizwalo vya mugati', isimangi'la, na kwitunga mukwato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' alasole ngulati' iv'i'li' ku'fuma ku' iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, na ng'ondi yi'mo ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aloni alayi'fumye ng'ombe nzagamba ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi ku'nguno yakwe mweni'ki'li', na ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yakwe mweni'ki'li' na ku'nguno ya mugana gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' alazisole i'zyo ngulati' iv'i'li' na ku'zitu'u'la ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe alese kav'ale ha igu'lya na i'zyo mbu'li iv'i'li', yi'mo ku'nguno yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu na yi'ngi' ku'nguno ya ku'somba wu'kenagu'zi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ku' Ki'ebulania i'yo mbu'li yi'ngi' yi'li' “ku'nguno ya Azazeli.” V'angi' mugati' na v'asomi v'ali'sani'zya ku'v'a Azazeli li'li' lina lya mugawo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Aloni alayi'lete ngulati' i'yo yi'lav'e yagwi'lagwa kav'ale ku'nguno yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, na ku'yi'fumya yi'v'e ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi ngulati' i'yo yi'lav'e yagwi'lagwa kav'ale ku'nguno ya ku'somba wu'kenagu'zi yi'laletwe ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'no yi'li' mpanga, ki'gele ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku' ku'yi'leku'li'la yi'ye ku' ibalangu' ku'no yi'wu'sombile wu'kenagu'zi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nawe Aloni alayi'lete ng'ombe nzagamba ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi wakwe mweni'ki'li', na ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yakwe na mugana gwakwe, nawe alayi'si'nze yeni'yo ng'ombe ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' alasole ki'tezo i'cho chokalile makala ga moto ago gafumile ha ihozezyo i'lo li'li' ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, na viganza viv'i'li' vya wu'bani wu'motu u'wo wu'siv'ilwe, na ku'vifila ha nnuma na muki'ngo gwa mugati'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' alawu'ti'ti'le wu'bani wenu'wo ha igu'lya na u'go moto ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ki'gele lyonsi lya wu'bani wenu'wo li'yi'si'gani'zye nfundi' ya wu'swanano i'yo yi'li' ha igu'lya na isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa, ki'gele ku'du' afwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alasole na lwandi' lwa magazi ga i'yo ng'ombe nzagamba ku' lyala lyakwe, na ku'ganyanyagi'la ha mbele ha igu'lya na nfundi' ya wu'swanano, hangi' alanyanyagi'le ha mbele ya nfundi' ya wu'swanano ku' lyala lyakwe kali' mupungati'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hangi' alayi'si'nze i'yo ngulati' ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi ku'nguno ya v'antu' v'ose. Magazi ga ngulati' yeni'yo alagingi'zye mugati' na muki'ngo gwa mugati', na av'ezye ki'ti' i'vyo wav'ezyaga magazi ga i'yo ng'ombe nzagamba, na ku'nyanyagi'la ha igu'lya na nfundi' ya wu'swanano, na ha mbele yalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'vi hu' vyene alahasosohye Hantu' Hasondo Muno, ku'nguno ya zoma ya V'aizilaeli, mahu'v'yo gav'o, na wu'kenagu'zi wav'o wose. Hangi' alav'ezye vyeni'vyo ku'nguno ya Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, i'lo li'li' mugati' nav'o av'o v'ali' na zoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' ninga yu'mo akazumi'ziwa ku'v'a mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya ha itungo i'lo Aloni alav'e ali'wingi'la Hantu' Hasondo Muno ku'v'ezya wu'swanano, mpaka aho alav'e wafuma ha ibala, aho alav'e wamali'la ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yakwe mweni'ki'li', mugana gwakwe haki'mo na iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Haho alafume ha ibala na ihema ha ihozezyo i'lo li'li' ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, na ku'li'sosohya. Alasole lwandi' lwa magazi ga ng'ombe nzagamba na lwandi' lwa magazi ga ngulati', na ku'v'ila ku' mapembe ga ihozezyo ku' ki'la lwandi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' magazi genago alaganyanyagi'le ha igu'lya na ihozezyo lyeni'lo kali' mupungati' ku' ku'tu'mi'la lyala lyakwe, na alali'sosohye na ku'li'sondohya ku'fuma ku' zoma ya V'aizilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nawe u'lu' wamali'la ku'hasosohya Hantu' Hasondo Muno, Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya na ihozezyo, haho alayi'lete i'yo ngulati' mpanga ya ku'somba wu'kenagu'zi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Aloni alatu'u'le makono gakwe av'i'li' ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa ngulati' yeni'yo mpanga, na ku'v'isu'la ha igu'lya yayo wu'kenagu'zi wose na mahu'v'yo gose ga V'aizilaeli, na ku'tu'u'la wu'kenagu'zi wav'o wose ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa ngulati' yeni'yo. Haho alayi'leku'li'le yi'ye ku' ibalangu' ku' ku'filwa na muntu' u'yo wapiv'ilwe wangali'zi wa muli'mo gwenu'go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbu'li yeni'yo yi'lawu'sombe ha igu'lya yayo wu'kenagu'zi wav'o wose, mpaka ku' lwandi' u'lo lu'li' wu'du'hu' v'antu', na muntu' mwenu'yo alayi'leku'li'le yi'ye ku' ibalangu'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
