        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aloni alaingi'le hangi' mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, nawe alavizule vizwalo vyakwe vya katani, i'vyo ndi' wazwalaga aho ali'wingi'la Hantu' Hasondo Muno, na ku'vileka mwenu'mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloge mu minzi' mwenu'mo mugati' na lu'gu'tu' lwa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, na ku'zwala vizwalo vyakwe vingi'. Haho alafume na ku'fumya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ku'nguno yakwe, na ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ku'nguno ya V'aizilaeli, ki'gele ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yakwe na ku'nguno ya v'antu' v'ose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' maguta ga ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi alagazigye ha igu'lya na ihozezyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Muntu' u'yo mwangali'zi wa ku'yi'fila i'yo ngulati' ya ku'somba wu'kenagu'zi, yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe na koga mu minzi', haho akowolile kwingi'la mu nkambi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'yo ng'ombe nzagamba haki'mo na i'yo ngulati', i'zyo zyafumiwa ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, i'zyo magazi gazyo ndi' gafilwa ha Hantu' Hasondo Muno ki'gele ku'v'ezya wu'swanano, yi'li'koov'iwa zifumiwe ha ibala na nkambi'. Ndi'li' zyazyo, nyama zyazyo, haki'mo na wu'se wazyo, vyose vitimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' u'yo alavitime yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe na koga mu minzi', haho akowolile kwingi'la mu nkambi'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nhama yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a ya nhananhana. Lu'siku' lwa iku'mi lwa mwezi gwa mupungati' yi'lamudime ku'hangamyoyo, ku'du' mwize mutu'mame muli'mo ninga gu'mo, inywe, muv'anda ninga mugeni mwizi'li'zi u'yo ikalile mugati' na inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulav'ezye vyeni'vyo ku'nguno lu'siku' lwenu'lo wu'swanano wu'lav'eziwe ku'nguno yinywe, ki'gele ku'musosohya. Haho mulasosoke wu'kenagu'zi winywe wose ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwenu'lo lu'li' lu'siku' lwa ku'lenda, na yi'li'mudima ku'hangamyoyo. Nhama yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a ya nhananhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' ki'la muhozya muhanya u'yo asimi'kilwe ki'gele ikali'le isumbi' lya wu'hozya lyamwa ise, alav'ezyage wu'swanano wenu'wo ku'no azwalile vizwalo i'vyo visondo vya katani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alasosohyage Hantu' Hasondo Muno, Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya haki'mo na ihozezyo, na ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno ya v'ahozya haki'mo na iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nhama yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a ya nhananhana ku' winywe. Wu'swanano wenu'wu' wu'lav'eziv'agwe kali' kamo ku' ki'la mwaka ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wose wa V'aizilaeli.” Haho gav'ezyekaga gose ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
